Store runtime config and backup/restore temporary files in DATABASE_DIR.

Serve /config.json from DATABASE_DIR in production so the packaged
application directory can stay read-only, and use Node's built-in .env
loader in the startup script so production builds do not need the
development-only dotenv package.

Allow SERVER_SOCKET to select a Unix socket for the systemd HTTP proxy.

